DESCRIPTION:New Yorker turned Berlin comedian Max Elias\, with a lot to say
  about both places\, offers up wild observations\, out-of-pocket comparison
 s and gleefully warped conclusions – it’s all good for a laugh at Airpl
 ane Baby. Identity\, social commentary\, a whole lot of dark thoughts the a
 verage baby definitely doesn't have\, and barbed musings abound throughout 
 this hour-long comic barrage. Get ready to be "educated" through a series o
 f culture shocks\, mismatched expectations and seemingly random facts. You'
 ll come in wondering what an airplane baby is supposed to be and leave a co
 uple kilos lighter from laughter.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comed
 y-atlas/event/airplane-baby/
